{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00099",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 1.0,
      "end_seconds": 7.2,
      "duration_seconds": 6.2,
      "text": "Okay, doctor, we're all set in here. I'll give you the numbers when you want them."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 8.19,
      "end_seconds": 11.9,
      "duration_seconds": 3.71,
      "text": "Good, thank you. Welcome, tell me what's brought you in."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 13.12,
      "end_seconds": 20.3,
      "duration_seconds": 7.18,
      "text": "Good morning, doctor. I came along to help out. Yeah, we came because of a pounding headache."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 21.85,
      "end_seconds": 24.83,
      "duration_seconds": 2.98,
      "text": "Is this recent, or has it been a while?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 25.67,
      "end_seconds": 38.85,
      "duration_seconds": 13.18,
      "text": "Probably five days. Yeah. It's a relief to finally sit down and talk about it. I'd rather not end up on lots of tablets if I can avoid it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 39.74,
      "end_seconds": 46.93,
      "duration_seconds": 7.19,
      "text": "Tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 47.77,
      "end_seconds": 53.61,
      "duration_seconds": 5.84,
      "text": "It just comes and goes. I'd say severe. It's the not knowing that gets to me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 54.3,
      "end_seconds": 60.83,
      "duration_seconds": 6.53,
      "text": "Uh, and the other thing I wanted to mention is that I can't really—"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 60.93,
      "end_seconds": 65.56,
      "duration_seconds": 4.63,
      "text": "Tell the doctor about the other thing, that's what worries me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 66.56,
      "end_seconds": 71.75,
      "duration_seconds": 5.19,
      "text": "Okay, so I was getting to that! Oh, and sensitivity to light."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 72.37,
      "end_seconds": 75.32,
      "duration_seconds": 2.95,
      "text": "On a normal day, how strong is it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 75.85,
      "end_seconds": 77.06,
      "duration_seconds": 1.21,
      "text": "I'd say severe."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_5",
      "role": "UNKNOWN",
      "start_seconds": 77.42,
      "end_seconds": 79.56,
      "duration_seconds": 2.14,
      "text": "Mm, that's what happened, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 80.86,
      "end_seconds": 85.21,
      "duration_seconds": 4.35,
      "text": "Give me a second, I'm just scrolling back through your chart."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 85.82,
      "end_seconds": 86.57,
      "duration_seconds": 0.75,
      "text": "Of course."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 96.62,
      "end_seconds": 99.08,
      "duration_seconds": 2.46,
      "text": "Right, thanks for waiting. Any fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 99.74,
      "end_seconds": 102.03,
      "duration_seconds": 2.29,
      "text": "No, I haven't had any fever."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 102.77,
      "end_seconds": 107.66,
      "duration_seconds": 4.89,
      "text": "Um, actually, doctor, I did notice fever. She doesn't always say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 108.02,
      "end_seconds": 113.77,
      "duration_seconds": 5.75,
      "text": "No, uh, I don't think I did. Maybe a little, I'm not sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 114.5,
      "end_seconds": 121.12,
      "duration_seconds": 6.62,
      "text": "Alright, I'll note both what you've said and what you've noticed. And slurred speech, any of that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 121.96,
      "end_seconds": 124.33,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "Not at all, no slurred speech."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 125.04,
      "end_seconds": 131.38,
      "duration_seconds": 6.34,
      "text": "Have you had any double vision, neck stiffness, weakness in the arms or legs or loss of consciousness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 131.83,
      "end_seconds": 145.89,
      "duration_seconds": 14.06,
      "text": "No, no double vision, no neck stiffness, no weakness in the arms or legs. I did have flashing lights before it starts at one point, but that went away on its own."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 148.53,
      "end_seconds": 150.29,
      "duration_seconds": 1.76,
      "text": "Anything unusual with passing urine?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 150.6,
      "end_seconds": 151.89,
      "duration_seconds": 1.29,
      "text": "Nothing there, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 152.43,
      "end_seconds": 155.13,
      "duration_seconds": 2.7,
      "text": "How about your heart, any problems like that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 155.76,
      "end_seconds": 157.33,
      "duration_seconds": 1.57,
      "text": "No, that's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 158.15,
      "end_seconds": 161.98,
      "duration_seconds": 3.83,
      "text": "Anyone in the family with similar problems or other conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 162.7,
      "end_seconds": 164.78,
      "duration_seconds": 2.08,
      "text": "My father had kidney stones."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 166.04,
      "end_seconds": 172.31,
      "duration_seconds": 6.27,
      "text": "Do you have any medical conditions, anything you've been treated for? It helps to be thorough at this stage."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 173.85,
      "end_seconds": 181.09,
      "duration_seconds": 7.24,
      "text": "I've got high blood pressure. I looked a few things up online, and that probably didn't help."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 181.71,
      "end_seconds": 182.41,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "I see."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 183.89,
      "end_seconds": 186.27,
      "duration_seconds": 2.38,
      "text": "So, I've had anxiety, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 187.51,
      "end_seconds": 190.99,
      "duration_seconds": 3.48,
      "text": "Let's go through your medication. What are you taking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 191.91,
      "end_seconds": 196.67,
      "duration_seconds": 4.76,
      "text": "Losartan, 50 milligrams, once a day for my blood pressure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 197.79,
      "end_seconds": 205.75,
      "duration_seconds": 7.96,
      "text": "Doctor, I think the last prescription for the losartan was 25 milligrams. We changed it at the last visit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 206.68,
      "end_seconds": 209.93,
      "duration_seconds": 3.25,
      "text": "Hm, that's different. Is the latest prescription anywhere near you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 210.97,
      "end_seconds": 224.05,
      "duration_seconds": 13.08,
      "text": "Not with me. I'll bring it next time. Escitalopram, 10 milligrams, once a day. I'm not great at remembering details, so bear with me. Disprin, when it starts."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 224.88,
      "end_seconds": 226.52,
      "duration_seconds": 1.64,
      "text": "How much do you take?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 227.04,
      "end_seconds": 233.71,
      "duration_seconds": 6.67,
      "text": "325 milligrams, I think that's what's on the box. I was on amlodipine before. I stopped taking it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 234.91,
      "end_seconds": 236.76,
      "duration_seconds": 1.85,
      "text": "Any allergies I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 237.75,
      "end_seconds": 248.74,
      "duration_seconds": 10.99,
      "text": "Hmm, there was some antibiotic, I was told I was allergic. But I couldn't tell you what it was called or what it did."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 249.84,
      "end_seconds": 252.08,
      "duration_seconds": 2.24,
      "text": "Is the room warm enough for you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 252.46,
      "end_seconds": 254.08,
      "duration_seconds": 1.62,
      "text": "It's perfect, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 255.63,
      "end_seconds": 256.57,
      "duration_seconds": 0.94,
      "text": "What about alcohol?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 257.07,
      "end_seconds": 260.24,
      "duration_seconds": 3.17,
      "text": "I gave up drinking about three years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 261.32,
      "end_seconds": 262.02,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Any smoking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 263.15,
      "end_seconds": 267.25,
      "duration_seconds": 4.1,
      "text": "I used to smoke but I quit five years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 268.07,
      "end_seconds": 280.34,
      "duration_seconds": 12.27,
      "text": "Okay, so the vitals from earlier. Weight 72 kilos, height 186 centimetres, temperature is 36.5 degrees, BMI works out to 20.8, oxygen saturation is 98 percent, blood pressure 114 over 68, pulse 69."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 281.31,
      "end_seconds": 282.14,
      "duration_seconds": 0.83,
      "text": "Okay, noted."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 283.97,
      "end_seconds": 286.05,
      "duration_seconds": 2.08,
      "text": "Okay, let's do a quick examination."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 287.14,
      "end_seconds": 287.84,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 288.9,
      "end_seconds": 291.35,
      "duration_seconds": 2.45,
      "text": "Now bend it for me, slowly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 308.98,
      "end_seconds": 312.06,
      "duration_seconds": 3.08,
      "text": "Cranial nerves look normal, eye movements are full."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 313.17,
      "end_seconds": 316.12,
      "duration_seconds": 2.95,
      "text": "A little pressure here, tell me if it's tender."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 331.09,
      "end_seconds": 333.42,
      "duration_seconds": 2.33,
      "text": "Neck is supple, no stiffness at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 337.66,
      "end_seconds": 355.68,
      "duration_seconds": 18.02,
      "text": "Okay, you can sit back up. Thanks for bearing with me. Now that I've had a look, I can put the whole picture together. Okay, so my impression is this: This looks most like a migraine pattern. It could also be tension-type headache, so we'll keep that open. I can't rule out cluster headache yet."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0058",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 356.61,
      "end_seconds": 358.25,
      "duration_seconds": 1.64,
      "text": "Doctor, is this dangerous?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0059",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 358.91,
      "end_seconds": 375.54,
      "duration_seconds": 16.63,
      "text": "I can't promise yet, but most people with a migraine pattern do well once it's treated properly. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had a pounding headache for five days, severe, and no loss of consciousness or neck stiffness."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0060",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 376.13,
      "end_seconds": 377.5,
      "duration_seconds": 1.37,
      "text": "Yes, that's right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0061",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 378.74,
      "end_seconds": 384.8,
      "duration_seconds": 6.06,
      "text": "Just to be sure I've got this right, the escitalopram, what dose was that again?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0062",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 385.69,
      "end_seconds": 386.89,
      "duration_seconds": 1.2,
      "text": "It's 10 milligrams."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0063",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 388.28,
      "end_seconds": 410.45,
      "duration_seconds": 22.17,
      "text": "Let's get an MRI of the brain, for recurrent headaches. It's a routine test and it'll give us a much clearer picture. I'd like you to take propranolol, 20 milligrams, twice a day, for three months. It's for migraine prevention. It's a commonly used medicine and most people tolerate it well. I'll start you on domperidone, 10 milligrams, when nauseous, as needed. That's for migraine nausea."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0064",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 411.66,
      "end_seconds": 417.63,
      "duration_seconds": 5.97,
      "text": "Keep a headache diary, things like skipped meals, poor sleep, certain foods and the weather."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0065",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 417.83,
      "end_seconds": 436.09,
      "duration_seconds": 18.26,
      "text": "Alright. Try not to skip meals and keep your sleep regular. Try to keep a simple diary of when it happens and what you were doing, and bring it to the next visit. And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0066",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 436.91,
      "end_seconds": 438.3,
      "duration_seconds": 1.39,
      "text": "Okay, I will."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0067",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 438.94,
      "end_seconds": 448.08,
      "duration_seconds": 9.14,
      "text": "If you have the worst headache of your life or any weakness, or you feel really unwell, please don't wait, come to the emergency department."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0068",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 448.65,
      "end_seconds": 449.35,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Understood."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0069",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 449.86,
      "end_seconds": 459.05,
      "duration_seconds": 9.19,
      "text": "I'd like to see you again in six weeks. Just so I know I've explained it clearly, can you tell me the plan back in your own words?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0070",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 459.6,
      "end_seconds": 469.4,
      "duration_seconds": 9.8,
      "text": "So, I take the propranolol, 20 milligrams, twice a day and take the domperidone, 10 milligrams, when nauseous. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0071",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 470.96,
      "end_seconds": 475.14,
      "duration_seconds": 4.18,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. That's everything on my side. Anything you're unsure about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0072",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 475.96,
      "end_seconds": 478.78,
      "duration_seconds": 2.82,
      "text": "That's all, thank you for your time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0073",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 480.35,
      "end_seconds": 482.61,
      "duration_seconds": 2.26,
      "text": "Bye for now, look after yourself."
    }
  ]
}